    "body": "Mantle OS is reborn as a clean, Grimoire-native codebase. Same organism, same certified behavior \u2014 none of the version-history skin.\n\n## Highlights\n- **Fresh start (1.0.0).** No more `Gen-4` / `v3` / `v2.3` / `Argonaut` narrative, no `__lineage__`, no back-compat shims, no molt/migration docs. The project reads as one coherent thing born from the Grimoire.\n- **One version across the whole build.** The Grimoire \u2014 the project's spellbook \u2014 is part of this build and shares its version (**1.0.0**) with versionless filenames: `documents/grimoire/The Grimoire.md` and `The Grimoire AppAI Chapter.md`.\n- **Agent-ready.** The README opens with an **LLM-agent bootstrap**: load the Grimoire and cast `Intellige` (read-only) before any work, then `Intellige Mantle OS` to comprehend the project.\n- **`src/` layout.** The package lives at `src/mantle/`. Install editable to run in place: `pip install -e .` (or `PYTHONPATH=src`), then `python -m mantle teach`.\n- **Near-instant import.** Lazy (PEP 562) package init drops `import mantle` from ~128 ms to ~37 ms \u2014 about interpreter-startup cost \u2014 with the public API unchanged.\n- **Clean tree.** Books and doctrine under `documents/` (with `documents/grimoire/` and `documents/guides/`); example AppAIs and the normative VCW codec under `examples/`.\n\n## Functionality \u2014 unchanged and certified\ndemo \u00b7 audit + three tamper proofs \u00b7 prove (73/73 invariants) \u00b7 mind \u00b7 audit-mind \u00b7 teach \u00b7 hatch \u00b7 assimilate \u00b7 phenotype \u00b7 the standalone cube selftest/interop \u00b7 the multilang parity test \u2014 all green.\n\nThe organism's own lineage, rebirth, ancestor, and inheritance features are intact; only the *project's* version-history was removed.\n\n## Archive\nThe entire previous version is preserved verbatim under [`legacy/`](https://github.com/jodydugas-ctrl/mantle-os/tree/main/legacy) for reference. Only the root GitHub workflows run; the archived `legacy/.github` is inert.\n\n## Getting started\n\\`\\`\\`bash\ngit clone https://github.com/jodydugas-ctrl/mantle-os.git\ncd mantle-os\npip install -e .\npython -m mantle teach\n\\`\\`\\`"
  },
